# ANCHORED. A bare `runs/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which
# silently swallowed `packages/web/app/runs/` — the route that lists runs — so
# the pages existed on disk, served fine, and could never be committed. The
# artifact directory is at the repo root and nowhere else.
/runs/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
